From 6202b01d06bcfd998926629dad0f5b6b10fc600d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 05:16:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] RQ2: fixes for the Qwen3-14B server and reproducible
 data_out

- split_sentences: deterministic regex splitter with abbreviation protection
  (pysbd no longer optional-dependent; 'Dr. Reyes' no longer split); data_out rebuilt
- generator: clamp max_tokens to GEN_MAX_TOKENS (host.py rejects > 2048)
- mask_ap: mask in 30-turn windows; an encounter whose LLM output cannot be
  parsed is left unmasked and reported instead of silently keeping the doctor's A/P
- chain: never cache an empty feature list
- verifier (openai backend): retry without logprobs on HTTP 422 as well as 400

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Undeku8id6Pc4QHZBrHz6w
